{"metadata":{"name":"Sahih al Bukhari","section":{"10":"Call to Prayers (Adhaan)"},"section_detail":{"10":{"hadithnumber_first":603,"hadithnumber_last":875,"arabicnumber_first":603,"arabicnumber_last":875,"name_native":"كتاب الصلاة"}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":649,"arabicnumber":649,"text":"قَالَ شُعَيْبٌ وَحَدَّثَنِي نَافِعٌ، عَنْ عَبْدِ اللَّهِ بْنِ عُمَرَ، قَالَ تَفْضُلُهَا بِسَبْعٍ وَعِشْرِينَ دَرَجَةً‏.‏","grades":[],"reference":{"book":10,"hadith":46}}]}